ed the lead to -21.4. Opus 5.5 replied with B1, which lost 13.3 and cut it to -8.1. That wasted much of the gift, but White stayed ahead and still won by 6."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "The player only ran libs.py, which parses a pasted board and prints each group's stones and liberties for the current position, and read and appended to games.md as notes. Nothing chose, ranked or looked ahead at moves, so there was no search.", "stop": false}}